  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for GraphicsMagick",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for GraphicsMagick fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-103118: uncontrolled recursion in the WPG file handler when processing crafted WPG files which are self-\n  referencing (bsc#1283767).\n- CVE-2026-109964: heap buffer underwrite in `DecodeImage()` of in PICT decoder due to pointer arithmetic overflow\n  (bsc#1285423).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
